{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Reinstate opt-in consent for trade union political fund contributions",
        "additional_details": "Since 18 Feb 2026, new members pay automatically unless they opt out. This reverses the Trade Union Act 2016 principle that consent must be actively given. Political funds support party politics \u2014 we believe your money should only go there if you choose it.\r\n \r\nRefunds should be available to those who opted out promptly but from whom funds were deducted without consent.",
        "background": "Amend Section 62 of the Employment Rights Act 2025 to restore explicit opt-in consent before any subscription is allocated to a union political fund.",
        "closed_at": null,
